        "ko": "언제부터 공부하셨어요?",
        "roman": "eonjebuteo gongbuhasyeosseoyo?",
        "en": "How long have you been studying?"
      },
      "audio_url": "u00-tutorial/d-05-r2"
    },
    {
      "seq": 6,
